    "The complete guide to digital business cards, QR, NFC, OCR and modern networking. Dozens of expert articles.": "O guia completo para cartões de visita digitais, QR, NFC, OCR e networking moderno. Dezenas de artigos especializados.",
    "The Complete Digital Card Guide": "O Guia Completo do Cartão Digital",
