    "Start free": "免费开始",
    "About Cardixn — The Story Behind the Luxury Digital Card": "关于 Cardixn — 奢华数字名片背后的故事",
    "Meet Cardixn: the digital business card platform replacing paper with instant NFC and QR sharing, luxury design and 20-language support.": "认识 Cardixn：一个数字名片平台，用即时 NFC 和 QR 分享、奢华设计以及20种语言支持取代纸质名片。",
    "About": "关于",
    "We're building the luxury end of paper cards": "我们正在打造纸质名片的奢华升级版",
    "Cardixn does one thing: digital business cards. No social network, no CRM — just the fastest, most elegant way to introduce yourself.": "Cardixn 只做一件事：数字名片。没有社交网络，没有 CRM —— 只是最快、最优雅的自我介绍方式。",
    "Cardixn started from a familiar moment: you run out of printed cards at exactly the wrong time, or you change roles and every card you ever handed out becomes wrong. Paper is beautiful but frozen; your professional identity is not.": "Cardixn 始于一个熟悉的场景：你在最不恰当的时候用完了纸质名片，或者你换了职位，之前发出去的每张名片都失效了。纸质名片很美但一成不变；而你的职业身份并非如此。",
    "So we built a card that lives online, shares by NFC tap, QR scan or a plain link, and updates instantly for everyone who saved it. Then we added an AI scanner that turns the paper cards you receive into clean contacts, and analytics that show what actually works.": "因此，我们制作了一张在线名片，可通过 NFC 轻触、QR 扫描或普通链接分享，并能为所有保存它的人即时更新。然后我们添加了一个 AI 扫描器，将您收到的纸质名片转换为整洁的联系人，以及显示实际效果的分析工具。",
    "Design isn't a detail here. Your card is a first impression, so every template, gradient and micro-interaction is tuned to feel like a premium product — on mobile first.": "设计在这里并非细节。您的名片是第一印象，因此每个模板、渐变和微交互都经过精心调整，以提供优质产品的感觉——首先在移动设备上。",
