    "Tap to share (NFC)": "轻触共享 (NFC)",
    "Write your card to any NFC tag or card and share your full profile with a single tap — no app needed on their phone.": "将您的名片写入任何NFC标签或卡片，只需轻触即可分享您的完整资料——对方手机无需安装应用程序。",
    "Dynamic QR code": "动态二维码",
    "Every card gets a high-resolution QR you can download and print. Update your details anytime — the QR never changes.": "每张名片都会生成一个可供下载和打印的高分辨率二维码。您可以随时更新详细信息——二维码本身永不改变。",
    "AI paper-card scanner": "AI 纸质名片扫描仪",
    "Snap a photo of any paper business card. Our AI reads the name, title, phone, email and website, then files it in your vault.": "拍摄任何纸质名片的照片。我们的AI会读取姓名、职称、电话、电子邮件和网站，然后将其归档到您的保管库中。",
    "Live contact vault": "实时联系人保管库",
    "Saved cards stay in sync. When someone updates their details, your copy updates automatically — no rescanning.": "保存的名片保持同步。当有人更新其详细信息时，您的副本会自动更新——无需重新扫描。",
    "Analytics that matter": "重要分析数据",
    "See views, taps and saves over the last 30 days so you know which cards and channels actually convert.": "查看过去30天的浏览量、点击量和保存量，以便了解哪些名片和渠道真正带来了转化。",
    "19 luxury templates": "19款奢华模板",
    "Premium layouts with glassmorphism, gradients and a custom accent color picker that themes the whole card page.": "采用玻璃态、渐变效果和自定义强调色选择器的高级布局，可为整个卡片页面设置主题。",
    "AI bio writing": "AI 简历撰写",
    "Generate a polished, professional bio in your language in one click — then refine it to sound exactly like you.": "一键生成一份精炼、专业的简历，然后进行润色，使其听起来完全符合您的个人风格。",
    "Social profiles built in": "内置社交资料",
    "Add 30+ platforms — WhatsApp, Instagram, LinkedIn, TikTok, Snapchat and more — with brand-accurate icons and handles.": "Add 30+ platforms — WhatsApp, Instagram, LinkedIn, TikTok, Snapchat and more — with brand-accurate icons and handles.",
    "Downloadable poster": "可下载海报",
    "Export your card as a 1080×1920 portrait image, ready for stories, WhatsApp status and print.": "将您的名片导出为1080×1920的竖版图片，可用于故事、WhatsApp状态和打印。",
    "20 languages, RTL ready": "20种语言，支持RTL排版",
    "Full Arabic RTL and 19 more languages, each on its own SEO-friendly URL with hreflang tags.": "完整的阿拉伯语 RTL 和其他19种语言，每种语言都有独立的、带有hreflang标签的SEO友好URL。",
    "Cloud sync": "云同步",
    "Everything lives in the cloud and syncs instantly across every device you sign in from.": "所有内容都存储在云端，并可在您登录的每台设备上即时同步。",
    "Private by design": "隐私优先设计",
    "Row-level security means only you can read and edit your cards and vault. Published cards show exactly what you choose.": "行级安全性意味着只有您才能读取和编辑您的名片和保管库。已发布的名片只会显示您选择的内容。",
    "Free QR Code Generator — Custom Colors, Logo, High-Res PNG | Cardixn": "免费二维码生成器 — 自定义颜色、徽标、高分辨率PNG | Cardixn",
    "Generate a free QR code for any URL, WiFi network, phone number or vCard. Customize colors, add a logo, download high-resolution PNG. No signup.": "为任何网址、WiFi网络、电话号码或vCard生成免费二维码。自定义颜色，添加徽标，下载高分辨率PNG。无需注册。",
    "Free QR Code Generator": "免费二维码生成器",
    "Instant, high-resolution, brand-colored QR codes. No signup.": "即时、高分辨率、品牌配色二维码。无需注册。",
    "Generate a QR code for any link, phone number, email, WiFi network or plain text in one click. Cardixn's free QR generator produces high-resolution PNG files ready for print, presentations, packaging, or NFC-plus-QR combo cards. Adjust foreground and background color, add error-correction, and download at up to 2000×2000 pixels. Unlimited use, no watermark, no account required.": "一键为任何链接、电话号码、电子邮件、WiFi网络或纯文本生成二维码。Cardixn 的免费二维码生成器可生成高分辨率PNG文件，适用于打印、演示、包装或NFC+QR组合名片。调整前景色和背景色，添加纠错功能，并可以高达2000×2000像素下载。无限使用，无水印，无需账户。",
    "Free vCard Generator — Downloadable .vcf Contact File | Cardixn": "免费 vCard 生成器 — 可下载的 .vcf 联系人文件 | Cardixn",
    "Create a downloadable .vcf vCard file with your contact information. Compatible with iPhone, Android, Outlook and Gmail. 100% free, no signup.": "创建包含您联系信息的 .vcf vCard 文件。兼容 iPhone、Android、Outlook 和 Gmail。100% 免费，无需注册。",
    "Free vCard (.vcf) Generator": "免费 vCard (.vcf) 生成器",
    "The one-file contact standard that works on every phone.": "适用于任何手机的单一文件联系人标准。",
    "A vCard (.vcf file) is the universal contact format that iPhone, Android, Outlook, Gmail and every modern address book understands. Enter your details, tap download, and you get a single file you can attach to emails, share on WhatsApp, or embed in a QR code. Cardixn's generator is free, unlimited, and never stores your data on our servers.": "vCard（.vcf 文件）是 iPhone、Android、Outlook、Gmail 以及所有现代通讯录都能识别的通用联系人格式。输入您的详细信息，点击下载，您将获得一个可附加到电子邮件、在 WhatsApp 上分享或嵌入到二维码中的单一文件。Cardixn 的生成器免费、无限制，并且绝不会将您的数据存储在我们的服务器上。",
    "Free Email Signature Generator — HTML for Gmail & Outlook | Cardixn": "免费电子邮件签名生成器 — 适用于 Gmail 和 Outlook 的 HTML | Cardixn",
    "Build a professional HTML email signature in under a minute. Copy and paste into Gmail, Outlook, or Apple Mail. Includes social links and QR.": "在一分钟内创建专业的 HTML 电子邮件签名。复制并粘贴到 Gmail、Outlook 或 Apple Mail 中。包含社交链接和二维码。",
    "Free Email Signature Generator": "免费电子邮件签名生成器",
    "A professional signature in every reply you send.": "您发送的每封回复都附带专业签名。",
    "First impressions include the last thing you send. A polished email signature adds a photo, title, phone, website and social links to every message — without you retyping them. Cardixn's generator outputs clean, table-based HTML compatible with Gmail, Outlook (desktop and web), Apple Mail and Superhuman. Copy the rendered signature or the raw HTML and paste it into your mail client's signature settings.": "第一印象也包含您发送的最后一件事。一个精美的电子邮件签名可以为每条消息添加照片、职称、电话、网站和社交链接——无需您手动重新输入。Cardixn的生成器输出干净、基于表格的HTML，兼容Gmail、Outlook（桌面和网页版）、Apple Mail和Superhuman。复制渲染后的签名或原始HTML，并将其粘贴到您的邮件客户端签名设置中。",
