    "Start free": "免費開始",
    "About Cardixn — The Story Behind the Luxury Digital Card": "關於Cardixn — 奢華數位名片背後的故事",
    "Meet Cardixn: the digital business card platform replacing paper with instant NFC and QR sharing, luxury design and 20-language support.": "認識Cardixn：數位名片平台，用即時NFC和QR分享、奢華設計及20種語言支援取代傳統紙質名片。",
    "About": "關於",
    "We're building the luxury end of paper cards": "我們正在打造紙質名片的奢華顛峰",
    "Cardixn does one thing: digital business cards. No social network, no CRM — just the fastest, most elegant way to introduce yourself.": "Cardixn只做一件事：數位名片。沒有社交網絡，沒有CRM——只有最快速、最優雅的自我介紹方式。",
    "Cardixn started from a familiar moment: you run out of printed cards at exactly the wrong time, or you change roles and every card you ever handed out becomes wrong. Paper is beautiful but frozen; your professional identity is not.": "Cardixn源於一個熟悉的時刻：你在最糟糕的時候用完了名片，或者你換了職位，你發出去的每張名片都變成了錯誤。紙質名片很美但卻固定不變；你的專業形象卻不是。",
    "So we built a card that lives online, shares by NFC tap, QR scan or a plain link, and updates instantly for everyone who saved it. Then we added an AI scanner that turns the paper cards you receive into clean contacts, and analytics that show what actually works.": "因此，我們打造了一張線上的名片，可以透過NFC輕觸、QR掃描或普通連結分享，並為所有儲存它的人即時更新。接著，我們添加了一個AI掃描器，將你收到的紙質名片轉換成清晰的聯絡人，以及顯示實際效果的分析。",
    "Design isn't a detail here. Your card is a first impression, so every template, gradient and micro-interaction is tuned to feel like a premium product — on mobile first.": "在這裡，設計不是細節。你的名片是第一印象，因此每個模板、漸變和微互動都經過精心調整，以提供優質產品的體驗——特別是針對行動裝置。",
    "Come build with us": "和我們一起打造",
    "Create your digital card today, or tell us what to build next — we read everything.": "立即創建您的數位名片，或告訴我們下一步要開發什麼——我們閱讀所有意見。",
    "Contact us": "聯絡我們",
