    "Free Professional Tools — QR, vCard & Email Signature | Cardixn": "免費專業工具 — QR、vCard 和電子郵件簽名 | Cardixn",
    "Free professional toolkit: QR generator, vCard downloader, email signature builder. No signup, no watermarks, unlimited use.": "免費專業工具包：QR 生成器、vCard 下載器、電子郵件簽名生成器。無需註冊，無浮水印，無限使用。",
