    "Open tool": "開啟工具",
    "Tap to share (NFC)": "輕觸分享 (NFC)",
    "Write your card to any NFC tag or card and share your full profile with a single tap — no app needed on their phone.": "將您的名片寫入任何NFC標籤或卡片，只需輕觸一下即可分享您的完整個人檔案——對方手機無需安裝應用程式。",
    "Dynamic QR code": "動態QR碼",
    "Every card gets a high-resolution QR you can download and print. Update your details anytime — the QR never changes.": "每張名片都有一個可下載和列印的高解析度QR碼。您可以隨時更新詳細資訊——QR碼永不改變。",
    "AI paper-card scanner": "AI紙質名片掃描器",
    "Snap a photo of any paper business card. Our AI reads the name, title, phone, email and website, then files it in your vault.": "拍攝任何紙質名片。我們的AI會讀取姓名、職稱、電話、電子郵件和網站，然後將其存入您的檔案庫。",
    "Live contact vault": "實時聯絡人檔案庫",
    "Saved cards stay in sync. When someone updates their details, your copy updates automatically — no rescanning.": "已儲存的名片會保持同步。當有人更新其詳細資訊時，您的副本會自動更新——無需重新掃描。",
    "Analytics that matter": "關鍵分析數據",
    "See views, taps and saves over the last 30 days so you know which cards and channels actually convert.": "See views, taps and saves over the last 30 days so you know which cards and channels actually convert.",
    "19 luxury templates": "19款奢華範本",
    "Premium layouts with glassmorphism, gradients and a custom accent color picker that themes the whole card page.": "採用玻璃擬態、漸層和自訂強調色選擇器的優質佈局，為整個名片頁面設定主題。",
    "AI bio writing": "AI履歷撰寫",
    "Generate a polished, professional bio in your language in one click — then refine it to sound exactly like you.": "一鍵生成精美、專業的您語言履歷——然後加以潤飾，使其聽起來與您一模一樣。",
    "Social profiles built in": "內建社交個人檔案",
    "Add 30+ platforms — WhatsApp, Instagram, LinkedIn, TikTok, Snapchat and more — with brand-accurate icons and handles.": "添加30多個平台——WhatsApp、Instagram、LinkedIn、TikTok、Snapchat等——帶有品牌準確的圖標和帳號。",
    "Downloadable poster": "可下載海報",
    "Export your card as a 1080×1920 portrait image, ready for stories, WhatsApp status and print.": "將您的名片匯出為1080×1920的直向圖像，可用於故事、WhatsApp狀態和列印。",
    "20 languages, RTL ready": "20種語言，支援RTL",
    "Full Arabic RTL and 19 more languages, each on its own SEO-friendly URL with hreflang tags.": "完整的阿拉伯語RTL和19種其他語言，每種語言都有其獨立的SEO友好URL和hreflang標籤。",
    "Cloud sync": "雲端同步",
    "Everything lives in the cloud and syncs instantly across every device you sign in from.": "所有內容都儲存在雲端，並在您登入的每個裝置上即時同步。",
    "Private by design": "設計上即為私密",
    "Row-level security means only you can read and edit your cards and vault. Published cards show exactly what you choose.": "行級安全性意味著只有您才能讀取和編輯您的名片和檔案庫。發布的名片會準確顯示您選擇的內容。",
    "Free QR Code Generator — Custom Colors, Logo, High-Res PNG | Cardixn": "免費QR碼生成器 — 自訂顏色、標誌、高解析度PNG | Cardixn",
    "Generate a free QR code for any URL, WiFi network, phone number or vCard. Customize colors, add a logo, download high-resolution PNG. No signup.": "為任何URL、WiFi網路、電話號碼或vCard生成免費QR碼。自訂顏色，添加標誌，下載高解析度PNG。無需註冊。",
    "Free QR Code Generator": "免費QR碼生成器",
    "Instant, high-resolution, brand-colored QR codes. No signup.": "即時、高解析度、品牌色QR碼。無需註冊。",
    "Generate a QR code for any link, phone number, email, WiFi network or plain text in one click. Cardixn's free QR generator produces high-resolution PNG files ready for print, presentations, packaging, or NFC-plus-QR combo cards. Adjust foreground and background color, add error-correction, and download at up to 2000×2000 pixels. Unlimited use, no watermark, no account required.": "一鍵為任何連結、電話號碼、電子郵件、WiFi網路或純文字生成QR碼。Cardixn的免費QR碼生成器可產生高解析度PNG檔案，適用於列印、演示、包裝或NFC加QR組合卡片。調整前景和背景顏色，添加錯誤修正，並以高達2000×2000像素下載。無限使用，無浮水印，無需帳戶。",
    "Free vCard Generator — Downloadable .vcf Contact File | Cardixn": "免費vCard生成器 — 可下載的.vcf聯絡人檔案 | Cardixn",
    "Create a downloadable .vcf vCard file with your contact information. Compatible with iPhone, Android, Outlook and Gmail. 100% free, no signup.": "創建一個包含您的聯絡資訊的可下載.vcf vCard檔案。相容於iPhone、Android、Outlook和Gmail。100%免費，無需註冊。",
    "Free vCard (.vcf) Generator": "免費vCard (.vcf) 生成器",
    "The one-file contact standard that works on every phone.": "適用於所有手機的單一檔案聯絡人標準。",
    "A vCard (.vcf file) is the universal contact format that iPhone, Android, Outlook, Gmail and every modern address book understands. Enter your details, tap download, and you get a single file you can attach to emails, share on WhatsApp, or embed in a QR code. Cardixn's generator is free, unlimited, and never stores your data on our servers.": "vCard（.vcf檔案）是iPhone、Android、Outlook、Gmail以及所有現代通訊錄都能理解的通用聯絡人格式。輸入您的詳細資訊，點擊下載，您將獲得一個可以附加到電子郵件、在WhatsApp上分享或嵌入QR碼的單一檔案。Cardixn的生成器是免費、無限的，並且從不在我們的伺服器上儲存您的數據。",
    "Free Email Signature Generator — HTML for Gmail & Outlook | Cardixn": "免費電子郵件簽名生成器 — 適用於Gmail和Outlook的HTML | Cardixn",
    "Build a professional HTML email signature in under a minute. Copy and paste into Gmail, Outlook, or Apple Mail. Includes social links and QR.": "在一分鐘內建立專業的HTML電子郵件簽名。複製並貼上到Gmail、Outlook或Apple Mail。包含社交連結和QR碼。",
    "Free Email Signature Generator": "免費電子郵件簽名生成器",
    "A professional signature in every reply you send.": "您發送的每封回覆都帶有專業簽名。",
    "First impressions include the last thing you send. A polished email signature adds a photo, title, phone, website and social links to every message — without you retyping them. Cardixn's generator outputs clean, table-based HTML compatible with Gmail, Outlook (desktop and web), Apple Mail and Superhuman. Copy the rendered signature or the raw HTML and paste it into your mail client's signature settings.": "第一印象包括您發送的最後一件事。一個精美的電子郵件簽名會為每封郵件添加照片、職稱、電話、網站和社交連結——無需您重新輸入。Cardixn的生成器產出乾淨、基於表格的HTML，相容於Gmail、Outlook（桌面和網頁版）、Apple Mail和Superhuman。複製渲染後的簽名或原始HTML並將其貼到您的郵件客戶端簽名設定中。",
